    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690570/extras/775084d3611e4ffdac486ff64956cacb.webp?t=1708763578\" width=235 height=54 /></span><br>Sprite Wars is a top-down arena shooter roguelite. Use, develop and purchase any of 8 unique weapons and 4 different skills. Fight bosses and show your enemies who the real boss is at the end of 40 levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2690570/extras/ea9c5c90f2eda19d60fb5d79057e36ba.webp?t=1708763578\" width=235 height=50 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>8 unique weapons and 4 different skills</strong><br></li><li><strong>Variety of enemies and bosses</strong><br></li><li><strong>Choose weapons, upgrade skills, unlock masteries</strong><br></li><li><strong>Bonus objectives for more rewards!</strong><br></li><li><strong>Long playing time and challenging levels</strong><br></li><li><strong>Auto save system</strong><br></li><li><strong>Cute graphics and colourful atmosphere</strong></li></ul>",
